%% Receiving document lifecycle. See prd.md section 9 and technical-spec.md section 7.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT: create (SUPERVISOR)
  DRAFT --> OPEN: open, needs at least 1 line
  DRAFT --> CANCELLED: cancel with reason
  OPEN --> IN_PROGRESS: first receipt (automatic)
  OPEN --> CANCELLED: cancel with reason
  IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS: more receipts
  IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: complete, all lines fully received
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
